  "label": "general internet meme audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with pop culture, internet humor conventions, and the actor Michael J. Fox. The humor relies on cultural knowledge of ice cream shops offering more than just shakes, the irony of juxtaposing a high-status image (Michael J. Fox in a tuxedo) with a mundane product (shakes), and the common meme structure of subverting expectations. The target audience understands these references and finds the contrast humorous, even if it implies a critique of the business owner.",
